-// For the 32-bit sizes the operation is done on the low word and the result
-// re-canonicalised (7.6); upper input bits never reach the result.
+// For the 32-bit sizes the operation is done on the low word and upper input
+// bits never reach the result. AndImmediate's 32-bit result is ZERO-extended
